<title>UK: DB Capital Markets sets warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets sets warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued seven million American-style call and put warrants, in seven equal tranches, on the U.S. dollar/mark exchange rate, lead manager Deutsche Bank said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> LISTING	    FFURT, DUSS	    PAYDATE	31.JAN.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   U.S$/DEM 1.6315</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE    STRIKE    ISSUE     MATURITY    PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> CALL    1.70 DEM  0.45 DEM  17.MAR.97   4.47 PCT  362.56 X</p>
<p> CALL    1.70 DEM  1.24 DEM  16.JUN.97   4.96 PCT  131.57 X</p>
<p> CALL    1.70 DEM  1.86 DEM  15.SEP.97   5.34 PCT  87.72 X</p>
<p> CALL    1.70 DEM  2.19 DEM  15.DEC.97   5.54 PCT  74.50 X</p>
<p> CALL    1.70 DEM  2.54 DEM  16.MAR.98   5.76 PCT  64.23 X</p>
<p> PUT     1.60 DEM  3.26 DEM  16.JUN.97   3.93 PCT  50.05 X</p>
<p> PUT     1.60 DEM  4.66 DEM  15.SEP.97   4.79 PCT  35.01 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
